[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755384667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104649#issuecomment-2755384667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104649","id":2755384667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kO9Vb","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-26T18:20:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-26T18:20:48Z","body":"> Binary size decreases a tiny bit by this (100kb), differences in launch times are negligible for me.\r\n\r\nI can't reproduce this on my end with stripped Linux x86_64 release export templates (`production=yes lto=full`):\r\n\r\n- `master`: 72,777,624 bytes\r\n- This PR: 72,785,816 bytes\r\n\r\nEither way, it's not a dealbreaker.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2755384667/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764613746","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104649#issuecomment-2764613746","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104649","id":2764613746,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyKhy","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T15:26:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T15:26:46Z","body":"I'm not super familiar with `ref` but as asked (and pedro might not be around), just to check, are there any race conditions to take care of here as `RefCounted` uses safe numerics (i.e. can something use the old version while it is being assigned)?\r\n\r\nOr is this impossible to happen due to where these move semantics are used?\r\n\r\n(I would rather ask a stupid question, than miss something :grin: !)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764613746/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764631815","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104649#issuecomment-2764631815","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104649","id":2764631815,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kyO8H","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-30T16:16:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-30T16:39:50Z","body":"> I'm not super familiar with `ref` but as asked (and pedro might not be around), just to check, are there any race conditions to take care of here as `RefCounted` uses safe numerics (i.e. can something use the old version while it is being assigned)?\r\n> \r\n> Or is this impossible to happen due to where these move semantics are used?\r\n> \r\n> (I would rather ask a stupid question, than miss something 😁 !)\r\n\r\nI'm happy to indulge!\r\n`Ref` move semantics are equivalent to relocation of `Ref`, e.g. as we already do when growing a `Vector<Ref<...>>` (through `realloc`). Technically, this means ownership of the incrementation held by `Ref` to the `RefCounted`'s `SafeNumeric` (`refcount`) is transferred without touching `refcount` at all. There shouldn't be any risk of race conditions.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2764631815/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766861524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104649#issuecomment-2766861524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104649","id":2766861524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k6vTU","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T17:09:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T17:09:59Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766861524/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]